# populated, text, per-finding: the ONE case that records printFindingLines. The history views print a line per scan record and the JSON views a key per finding, so neither pins what a person reads under a finding — which is where the reachability state and the instrument that produced it are stated.
$ kanonarion vuln-show example.com/mod@v1.2.0
exit 0
